ETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Creatine is a naturally occurring nitrogenous organic acid found in vertebrates and helps to supply energy to muscle. Creatine is produced naturally in the body primarily in the kidneys and liver from the amino acids L-arginine, glycine, and L-methionine and then transported in the blood stream for use by muscles. It promotes healthy nerdy levels, my improve cognitive ability and may boost strength and endurance."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"SUGGESTED USE: Blend one scoop of CREATINE MONOHYDRATE with 6-8 oz. (180-236ml) of water, juice, or other favorite beverages."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING\nIf you are pregnant, nursing, have any health condition or are taking any medications, consult your health care practitioner before using this product."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use this product if the safety seal on the bottle is broken."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2014-06-25","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":19.8,"operator":"=","quantity":50,"unit":"{Calories}","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit"